16:11.399 --> 16:11.960
Baik.

16:23.600 --> 16:24.360
Helo, Huan'er.

16:24.919 --> 16:25.519
Tiehan.

16:26.039 --> 16:27.480
Kau dah minta cuti hari ini?

16:28.200 --> 16:28.879
Cuti?

16:29.200 --> 16:30.919
Ya, Haiming cakap...

16:31.039 --> 16:32.159
